  "contract": {
    "passes": "For each m in 0, 1, 2, count primes through the inclusive limit (limit >> m).",
    "sieve": "Each pass initializes a packed bitset to all ones. Visit i from 2 through its inclusive limit; when i is set, count it and flip each still-set multiple beginning at 2*i.",
    "output": "Return the three counts as little-endian unsigned 64-bit words in pass order. The caller-supplied limit is bounded at 1000000 to keep the source's three full passes practical."
  },
